WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:03,460
Of course that's what I thought

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:06,460
It's a pity that I am too poor to buy a car or a house.

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:11,100
Coming here is not a bad thing for me, right?

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,100
Is the garage important?

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,100
If anyone could go with me for roadside food

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,100
Accompany me to buy clothes on sale

7
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,100
Just stay with me

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:22,640
Even if it is poor, I am willing

9
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:25,640
In the past, everyone of the older generation was very poor.

10
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:27,800
Aren’t you living a happy life too?

11
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,800
From the moment I was abandoned by my parents

12
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,800
I think love is the most important thing to me

13
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,800
After all, no matter how poor you are, as long as you are not lazy, you can still have trouble eating.

14
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,800
Yeah, you're right

15
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,860
So let’s eat quickly

16
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:41,860
if we can live a long time

17
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:44,860
I think what you need I will give you
